description:
Recent earthquakes from the USGS real-time catalog (worldwide, up to 30 days): time, magnitude, place, depth, tsunami flag and impact alert; optionally near a city or coordinates.
Use when: "earthquakes today", "was there an earthquake in Tokyo?", "séismes en Italie cette semaine".
Example: {"min_magnitude":4.5,"days":1} or {"place":"Tokyo","days":7,"min_magnitude":3}
